      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "此の金（このきん）三朱銭三十五文／此の米（このこめ）二升四合一勺三才"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Double-column inline note (warichu) on the 1,911 mon cash line, giving two conversions of it. Right half: in gold, 3 shu plus 35 mon — 3 shu = 3/16 ryō = 0.1875 ryō. Left half: in rice, 0.02413 koku (2 shō + 4 gō + 1 shaku + 3 sai). Boxed as one rectangle because a warichu is a single typographic unit."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "此金"
